[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548719599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-3548719599","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":3548719599,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ThSnv","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T17:14:29Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T17:14:29Z","body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/379b2c57-63b3-457e-896c-b6134f81f1cd","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548719599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800541161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-3800541161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":3800541161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ih6fp","user":{"login":"B1tHat","id":245917453,"node_id":"U_kgDODqhnDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245917453?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat","html_url":"https://github.com/B1tHat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/B1tHat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:37:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:37:12Z","body":"Although it's been quite a while, I noticed that if there is a **LightOccluder2D** in the scene, the particles become _visible_ again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800541161/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4135383044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-4135383044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":4135383044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72fPAE","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T14:29:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T14:29:46Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on my machine. AMD/Radeon card.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4135383044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4137673266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-4137673266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":4137673266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72n-Iy","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T19:30:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T19:40:10Z","body":"> Although it's been quite a while, I noticed that if there is a **LightOccluder2D** in the scene, the particles become _visible_ again.\n\nI tried downloading the project again and was able to reproduce on 4.7.dev2.\n\nAnd yes, it appears that adding the light occluder and setting the polygon does make the particles visible again, regardless if there is any collision with the occluder shape.\n\nToggling the visibility of the LightOccluder2D node, or otherwise clearing the occluder polygon shape, or deleting the node will go back to making the particles invisible again.\n\nInterestingly, disabling the SDF Collision property of the LightOccluder2D also makes the particles invisible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4137673266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231918438","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-4231918438","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":4231918438,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78PfNm","user":{"login":"corkr900","id":109830893,"node_id":"U_kgDOBovi7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109830893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900","html_url":"https://github.com/corkr900","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corkr900/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T16:29:14Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T16:29:14Z","body":"I am also encountering this on 4.6. Particles are fully invisible when collision mode is rigid, and when I have a LightOccluder2D in the scene, the particles are very briefly visible (for a frame or so) before disappearing, but only if the lightoccluder is visible. RTX 5070 ti","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231918438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5894319238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-5894319238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":5894319238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABX1Qshg","user":{"login":"Starwer","id":8810885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MTA4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8810885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer","html_url":"https://github.com/Starwer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Starwer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:20Z","body":"I also have the same problem on Godot 4.7 with my old GeForce GT 620. \nEverything's consistent with what has been said so far.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5894319238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6129933736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-6129933736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":6129933736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbV9dqA","user":{"login":"coatline","id":50183905,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTgzOTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50183905?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline","html_url":"https://github.com/coatline","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coatline/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T18:11:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T18:14:01Z","body":"I have the same problem on 4.7.2-stable with GeForce RTX 3050 and GeForce RTX 4070 Ti. Adding/removing a LightOccluder2D doesn't seem to change anything.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6129933736/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6147020417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-6147020417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":6147020417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbmQWgQ","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:48:12Z","body":"> 12\\. I have the same problem on 4.7.2-stable with GeForce RTX 3050 and GeForce RTX 4070 Ti. Adding/removing a LightOccluder2D doesn't seem to change anything.\n\nThe LightOccluder2D must have a valid OccluderPolygon2D assigned for the particles to become visible again. (This removes the node's warning and allows the occluder to take effect once you reload the scene.)\n\nAlso, SDF Collision must be enabled on the LightOccluder2D node (this should be enabled by default.)\n\nSee below:\n\n<img width=\"950\" height=\"599\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8d6e65e-2a96-4955-b447-318843942465\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6147020417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6150325184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926#issuecomment-6150325184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112926","id":6150325184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbpaDwA","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T16:33:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:43:08Z","body":"Targeted engine fix here:\n[drivers/gles3/shaders/canvas_sdf.glsl](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/gles3/shaders/canvas_sdf.glsl#L49)\n\nReplace:\n```\nvec4 float_to_vec4(float p_float) {\n    highp vec4 comp = fract(p_float * vec4(255.0 * 255.0 * 255.0, 255.0 * 255.0, 255.0, 1.0));\n\tcomp -= comp.xxyz * vec4(0.0, 1.0 / 255.0, 1.0 / 255.0, 1.0 / 255.0);\n\treturn comp;\n}\n```\n\nWith:\n```\nvec4 float_to_vec4(float p_float) {\n    if (p_float >= 1.0) {\n        return vec4(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n    }\n    highp vec4 comp = fract(p_float * vec4(255.0 * 255.0 * 255.0, 255.0 * 255.0, 255.0, 1.0));\n\tcomp -= comp.xxyz * vec4(0.0, 1.0 / 255.0, 1.0 / 255.0, 1.0 / 255.0);\n\treturn comp;\n}\n```\n\nThe shader's float_to_vec4() function uses fract(), which wraps the positive endpoint 1.0 to zero. When the SDF contains no occluder geometry, the distance can saturate to this endpoint. So the SDF encoder wraps the maximum positive distance into a negative distance.\n\nThis fix is verified against 4.8 dev4; however fails the current master due to a regression here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124336\n\nParticle material UBO is declared at binding 2; but bound at binding 1.\nIn `drivers\\gles3\\shaders\\particles.glsl`, Change this line from:\n```\nlayout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:2\n```\nTo:\n```\nlayout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:1\n```\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6150325184/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]